    "text": "seattlemedium.com\nwebsite\nRenton\nRenton Police Arrest Man In Connection With Triple Homicide\nBy OP-ED,\n1 days agoThe Renton Police Department (RPD) has apprehended a 46-year-old man linked to a tragic triple homicide that occurred on Saturday night. Authorities discovered the deceased bodies of two women, aged 46 and 28, along with a 9-year-old girl, who had all been shot inside an apartment located near Kirkland Avenue Northeast and Northeast 18th Street around 7:30 p.m., according to an official statement from the RPD.\n8",
